('Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  Don\'t mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates\' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?','',27467,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,3,1,0,0,0,0,69497),
('This is getting good! It really warms the stomach! \n\nAnd $n, I have to say, you\'re a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!','This is getting good!  It really warms the stomach!  And $n, I have to say, you\'re a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!',27468,0,0,0,65,0,4,0,0,7,11,0,0,0,0,69497),
('This is good stuff! But it\'s a little weak. I think I\'ll add a little more garlic breath to it...','This is good stuff! But it\'s a little weak. I think I\'ll add a little more garlic breath to it...',27469,0,0,0,65,0,4,0,0,7,1,0,0,0,0,69497),
