('You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience.','You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience.',31313,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,274,0,0,1,0,0,69497),
