('We cannot allow the Alliance to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave warriors there?','We cannot allow the Alliance to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave warriors there?',31316,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,66,0,0,1,0,0,69497),
