('','Oh my gosh! Keep your voice down, $n! What? Are you trying to get us killed?!$B$BOf course I know who you are! Who in the Alliance doesn\'t know the name, $n?!$B$BSay, what do you think of my jumpbot? She\'s based off of the mechagnome design. Sleek and aerodynamic!',32364,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,69497),
