('','Aaagh! It burns! What sorcery is this!?',38550,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,17015,0,0,0,0,0,0,69497),
('','There\'s an opening up ahead. GO NOW!',38551,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,17059,1,0,0,0,0,0,69497),
