('Witch Doctor Umbu spends his time walkin\' about de valley, tendin\' to de people and elemental spirits alike.$B$BLook for him around de central building.','Witch Doctor Umbu spends his time walkin\' about de valley, tendin\' to de people and elemental spirits alike.$B$BLook for him around de central building.',45413,1,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,396,0,0,0,0,0,69497),
