('Zamja be de best cook in Orgrimmar, mon.$B$BYou can find her just south of de valley\'s central building. Batamsi sells de food Zamja makes, too, if ya just be hungry.','Zamja be de best cook in Orgrimmar, mon.$B$BYou can find her just south of de valley\'s central building. Batamsi sells de food Zamja makes, too, if ya just be hungry.',45433,1,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,396,0,0,0,0,0,69497),
